OL,3,ACarney faces crucial test after walking
OL,4,Aaway from Trump's deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe United States and Canada have
OL,7,Fentered into uncharted territory.
OL,9,FThe longtime allies and economic
OL,10,Fpartners, who have enjoyed free trade
OL,11,Ffor decades, are now in an escalating
OL,12,Ftrade war with no clear off ramp.
OL,14,FAnd for Prime Minister Mark Carney, the
OL,15,Flate night decision to suspend talks
OL,16,Fwith President Donald Trump and to
OL,17,Fretaliate instead of agreeing to a deal
OL,18,Fthat seemed in reach will be a
OL,19,Fsignificant political test.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
